flowchart LR
    subgraph appHosts[Useai Application Hosts]
        cli[CLI]
        http[Loopback HTTP API]
        mcp[Read Only MCP]
        applicationHost[Application Host]
        store[(SQLite Store)]
    end
    subgraph sdk[Embeddable Rust SDK]
        core[Domain Library]
        pricing[Pricing Library]
        adapters[Provider Registry]
        traces[Trace Library]
    end
    subgraph otherHosts[Other Application Hosts]
        memz[Memz]
        memzHistory[(Memz History And Search)]
        foreignApps[Foreign Applications]
        foreignBindings[C ABI Bindings]
    end
    subgraph dataSources[Data Sources]
        localTraces[Local Trace Files]
        rateCatalog[Versioned Rate Catalog]
        upstream[Provider APIs And CLIs]
    end
    cli cli_host@-->|Calls| applicationHost
    http http_host@-->|Calls| applicationHost
    mcp mcp_host@-->|Reads through| applicationHost
    applicationHost app_core@-->|Evaluates accounting| core
    applicationHost app_pricing@-->|Values usage| pricing
    applicationHost app_collect@-->|Refreshes accounts| adapters
    applicationHost app_trace@-->|Reads traces| traces
    applicationHost app_store@-->|Persists typed rows| store
    adapters fetch@-->|Reads provider data| upstream
    pricing price_core@-->|Uses shared types| core
    pricing catalog_read@-->|Loads supplied catalog| rateCatalog
    traces trace_core@-->|Emits shared contracts| core
    traces trace_read@-->|Optionally reads| localTraces
    memz memz_trace@-->|Imports traces| traces
    memz memz_price@-->|Values usage| pricing
    memz memz_collect@-->|Optionally collects| adapters
    memz memz_history@-->|Owns records and search| memzHistory
    foreignApps foreign_call@-->|Calls| foreignBindings
    foreignBindings ffi_core@-->|Evaluates accounting| core
    foreignBindings ffi_price@-->|Values usage| pricing
    foreignBindings ffi_collect@-->|Optionally collects| adapters
    foreignBindings ffi_trace@-->|Optionally reads traces| traces
